<title>SLOVENIA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>SLOVENIA GOVERNMENT LIST (961118)</p>
<p>  **********************************************************</p>
<p>  * 18 Nov 96 - Final results gave the Liberal Democrats   *</p>
<p>  *		led by Prime Minister Janez Drnovsek 27.01  *</p>
<p>  *		percent of votes in the Nov 10 general	*</p>
<p>  *		election. The rightwing People's Party won  *</p>
<p>  *		19.38 percent, the centre-right Social	*</p>
<p>  *		Democrats 16.13 percent and the Christian   *</p>
<p>  *		Democrats 9.62 percent.			   *</p>
<p>  *		Drnovsek is likely to be called to form a   *</p>
<p>  *		new government.				     *</p>
<p>  **********************************************************</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p> President.........................................Milan KUCAN</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET (Formed 25 Jan 1993)</p>
<p> Prime Minister...........................Janez DRNOVSEK (LDS)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Agriculture &amp; Forestry......................Joze OSTERC (SKD)</p>
<p> Culture.......................................Janez DULAR (I)</p>
<p> Defence.....................................Jelko KACIN (LDS)</p>
<p> Economic Activities........................Metod DRAGONJA (I)</p>
<p> Economic Relations &amp; Development..........Janko DEZELAK (SKD)</p>
<p> Education &amp; Sports.........................Slavko GABER (LDS)</p>
<p> Environment................................Pavel GANTAR (LDS)</p>
<p> Finance...................................Mitja GASPARI (LDS)</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs..........................Davorin KRACUN (LDS)</p>
<p> Health....................................Bozidar VOLJC (LDS)</p>
<p> Internal Affairs............................Andrej STER (SKD)</p>
<p> Justice.....................................Meta ZUPANCIC (I)</p>
<p> Labour, Family &amp; Social Affairs................Tone ROP (LDS)</p>
<p> Science &amp; Technology........................Andrej UMEK (SKD)</p>
<p> Transport &amp; Communications....................Igor UMEK (SKD)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p>I - Independent</p>
<p>LDS - Liberal Democratic Party</p>
<p>SKD - Slovenian Christian Democrats</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p> Speaker of Parliament.............................Jozef SKOLC</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank Governor............................France ARHAR</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
